    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i get that but i reallycant go to the doctor right now i have so much work to do and wont have time for an appointment. i feel like i'm overreacting. it's probably just a little shock or something from the fall. if i just take some strong ibuprofen and rest in a dark room for like an hour will that be enough to get me through the day? i dont want to make a big deal out of nothing.",
